OL,3,CHistoric harbour facing 'catastrophic'
OL,4,Ccollapse after storm damage
OL,6,FAn historic harbour is on the verge of
OL,7,Fcollapse unless funds can be urgently
OL,8,Fraised to fix it, locals have warned.
OL,10,FLarge cracks have been temporarily
OL,11,Ffilled in Gorran Haven Harbour Quay,
OL,12,Fnear Mevagissey, Cornwall, but it
OL,13,Fneeds major work to carry out longer
OL,14,Fterm repairs, following storm damage
OL,15,Fearlier this year.
OL,17,FResidents say it would be
OL,18,F'catastrophic' to lose the quay and
OL,19,Fhave begun efforts to raise the
OL,20,F#120,000 The Gorran Haven Harbour
OL,21,FTrust (GHHT) needs to preserve it.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
