PN,40702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786880894
OL,3,CHistoric harbour facing 'catastrophic'
OL,4,Ccollapse after storm damage
OL,6,FThe quay, built in 1886, is currently
OL,7,Fused for boat moorings, access for
OL,8,Frecreational use and acts as a
OL,9,Fbreakwater to protect waterfront
OL,10,Fproperties.
OL,12,FGeoff Fox, from GHHT, said that the
OL,13,Fouter arms of the quay needed to be
OL,14,Funderpinned to prevent the end falling
OL,15,Foff and allowing the sea to disembowel
OL,16,Fthe rest of the quay
OL,18,FHe told ITV News: "The village depends
OL,19,Fvery much on the quay.
OL,26,@zD@SOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
