OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786880894
OL,3,CHistoric harbour facing 'catastrophic'
OL,4,Ccollapse after storm damage
OL,6,F"The waterfront properties are
OL,7,Fdependent upon it as a breakwater, the
OL,8,Frecreational facilities that it
OL,9,Fprovides, the moorings for the boats
OL,10,Fas well.
OL,12,F"So many people depend upon it and
OL,13,Fthat's why it's been a community
OL,14,Feffort over these past two months
OL,15,Fespecially in raising the funds to
OL,16,Frepair the quay.
OL,18,F"It's urgent, we need to do it before
OL,19,Fnext winter's storms."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUzD@AOU{D@VO]
